/**
 * Round-25: Inline skill file content (embedded as TS constants).
 *
 * Webpack bundles TS files but raw .md files don't get copied to dist/.
 * Rather than rely on file-system reads or webpack asset loaders (which add
 * complexity), we embed the markdown as TS string literals. The .md files
 * remain in the repo for human review; this file is generated from them.
 *
 * Source files (for reference, edit those then regenerate this file):
 *   - SKILL.md      (install + quick-start)
 *   - AUTH.md       (API token creation, scopes, errors)
 *   - API.md        (HTTP endpoints reference)
 *   - EXAMPLES.md   (bilingual copy-paste recipes)
 */
